<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Undangan Pernikahan | Faiz & Siti</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
      background: #f7f3ef;
      color: #333;
      text-align: center;
    }
    section {
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    h1, h2 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .cover {
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.4),rgba(0,0,0,.4)),
      url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529626455594-4ff0802cfb7e') center/cover;
      color: white;
    }
    .btn {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      background: #c59d5f;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 25px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .box {
      background: white;
      margin: 15px auto;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      max-width: 400px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- COVER -->
<section class="cover" id="cover">
  <h2>Undangan Pernikahan</h2>
  <h1>Faiz & Siti</h1>
  <p>11 Januari 2026</p>
  <button class="btn" onclick="bukaUndangan()">Buka Undangan</button>
</section>

<!-- MUSIK -->
<audio id="musik" loop>
  <source src="lagu.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
</audio>

<!-- ISI -->
<section id="isi" style="display:none;">
  <h2>Assalamu’alaikum Wr. Wb.</h2>
  <p>Dengan memohon rahmat Allah SWT, kami mengundang Bapak/Ibu/Saudara/i untuk hadir dalam pernikahan kami:</p>

  <div class="box">
    <h3>Faiz Sabilil Haq</h3>
    <p>&</p>
    <h3>Siti Nurazizah</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="box">
    <h3>Akad Nikah</h3>
    <p>Minggu, 11 Januari 2026</p>
    <p>08.00 WIB - Selesai</p>
  </div>

  <div class="box">
    <h3>Resepsi</h3>
    <p>Minggu, 11 Januari 2026</p>
    <p>11.00 WIB - 16.30 WIB</p>
  </div>

  <div class="box">
    <h3>Hitung Mundur</h3>
    <p id="countdown"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="box">
    <h3>Ucapan & Doa</h3>
    <div class="commentbox"></div>
  </div>

  <p>Merupakan suatu kehormatan dan kebahagiaan bagi kami.</p>
</section>

<!-- SCRIPT -->
<script src="https://unpkg.com/commentbox.io/dist/commentBox.min.js"></script>
<script>
  function bukaUndangan() {
    document.getElementById("cover").style.display = "none";
    document.getElementById("isi").style.display = "block";
    document.getElementById("musik").play();
  }

  // Countdown
  var target = new Date("Jan 11, 2026 08:00:00").getTime();
  setInterval(function() {
    var now = new Date().getTime();
    var jarak = target - now;
    var hari = Math.floor(jarak / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));
    document.getElementById("countdown").innerHTML = hari + " Hari Lagi";
  }, 1000);

  // Komentar
  commentBox('5723456789012345');
</script>

</body>
</html>
